{"c":[{"name":"20260826T014547Z-7e85524296498ed1","text":"Full local tox is tox run-parallel; do not pass pytest --basetemp (default already isolates outside the clone). Tests cache summem in conftest._SUMMEM because migrate.py and surgery.py overwrite sys.modules['summem'].","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T020511Z-dedaa99398372c27","text":"CI runs tox py311-py314 on pull requests and on main; tox -e coverage and the Codecov upload run only on pushes to main.","type":"note"}]}
